 "pages": {
  "default/32120.htm": {
   "file": "default/32120.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Balu Kaimu: The stone pillar looks like it was erected a long time ago. The top is worn and chipped in places, but the ancient letters on its face seem to be relatively bright and clear.",
   "header": "Balu Kaimu",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Quest",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Quest",
     "kind": "quest-menu",
     "to": "@questlist"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32120-01.html": {
   "file": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32120-01.html",
   "quest": 125,
   "text": "Balu Kaimu: The ancient stone pillar does not seem particularly unique, but you sense something secret and powerful in it. It almost seems to be waiting for something...or someone. Perhaps it is one of the pillars created by Shilen... Since you don't know how to communicate with the pillar, perhaps…",
   "header": "Balu Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 1|2|3|4|5"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32120-02.html": {
   "file": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32120-02.html",
   "quest": 125,
   "text": "Balu Kaimu: (Staring closely at the Pillar of Wisdom, the delicate letters on its face seem to move rhythmically. Given its location, this must be Balu Kaimu....)",
   "header": "Balu Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 6; st.get(\"Memo\") == null"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Touching the pillar seems to cause it to react. Try to communicate with it.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1 32120-03.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1",
     "event": "32120-03.html",
     "quest": 125,
     "to": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32120-03.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32120-09.html": {
   "file": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32120-09.html",
   "quest": 125,
   "text": "Balu Kaimu: Who...Who has awakened me from this silence you small and strange-looking creature has done it I have never seen such a strange-looking creature since Shilen gave me life...",
   "header": "Balu Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 6; !st.get(\"Memo\") == null"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "The speech is so fast and ill-translated that it's impossible to understand. Ask it to say it again slowly.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1 32120-10.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1",
     "event": "32120-10.html",
     "quest": 125,
     "to": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32120-10.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32120-17.html": {
   "file": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32120-17.html",
   "quest": 125,
   "text": "Balu Kaimu: To meet my brother, Chuta Kaimu, start here and travel southwest . You will find him where the road ends. To wake him from his slumber, speak only the word wagu , the same word that my mother Shilen spoke when she gave him life. Possibly he will share his wisdom with you.",
   "header": "Balu Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 7"
   ],
   "sets": {
    "cond": "7"
   },
   "outcome": "cond",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32119-18.html": {
   "file": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32119-18.html",
   "quest": 125,
   "text": "Ulu Kaimu: My brother Balu Kaimu stands under a tree near the road if you travel south from here. Communicate with him in the same way you have with me. Awaken him with the word toon , which Shilen first said to him when she gave him life. He will share his wisdom with you.",
   "header": "Ulu Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED"
   ],
   "sets": {
    "cond": "6"
   },
   "outcome": "cond",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32120-1.html": {
   "file": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32120-1.html",
   "quest": 126,
   "text": "Balu Kaimu: This is the Pillar of Wisdom known as Balu Kaimu! Communication is not possible at the moment -- it seems that you didn't take all the steps necessary for communication.",
   "header": "Balu Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 1|2|3|4"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32120-2.html": {
   "file": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32120-2.html",
   "quest": 126,
   "text": "Balu Kaimu: To communicate with Balu Kaimu, place your hands on the pillar and think about the question you wish to ask. As you do so, the ancient letters moving rhythmically on the face of the pillar seem to gather around your hands. You feel a sensation of warmth.",
   "header": "Balu Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 5"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Balu Kaimu has recognized you.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2 32120-3.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2",
     "event": "32120-3.html",
     "quest": 126,
     "to": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32120-3.html",
     "effect": "cond:6"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32120-3c.html": {
   "file": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32120-3c.html",
   "quest": 126,
   "text": "Balu Kaimu: Balu Kaimu awaits your response after completing its search concerning Gazkh and abnormal phenomena.",
   "header": "Balu Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 6"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Try to communicate with it.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2 32120-3b.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2",
     "event": "32120-3b.html",
     "quest": 126,
     "to": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32120-3b.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32120-4c.html": {
   "file": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32120-4c.html",
   "quest": 126,
   "text": "Balu Kaimu: This melody...so similar to the one I heard before from Ulu Kaimu. It sounds like another verse of the previous melody.",
   "header": "Balu Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 7"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Carefully listen to the melody.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2 32120-4a.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2",
     "event": "32120-4a.html",
     "quest": 126,
     "to": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32120-4a.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32120-5a.html": {
   "file": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32120-5a.html",
   "quest": 126,
   "text": "Balu Kaimu: You will find Chuta Kaimu at the very end of the southwest area. I know my brother will shine the light of wisdom upon you...",
   "header": "Balu Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Listen to the melody's second verse once more.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2 32120-5b.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2",
     "event": "32120-5b.html",
     "quest": 126,
     "to": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32120-5b.html"
    }
   ]
  },
